{
 "meta": {
  "lane": "a",
  "task": "t119",
  "chunk": "a/032",
  "family": "NOR10"
 },
 "entries": [
  {
   "key": "u08080",
   "en": "One of my sisters.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08081",
   "en": "Uh, I should be inspecting my firearm.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08082",
   "en": "No, sir. You don't.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08083",
   "en": "Sorry about that. It won't happen again.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08084",
   "en": "Until I get home and kill her.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08085",
   "en": "That's Sarah. The youngest.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08086",
   "en": "Surprised to see you here, sir. Thought you'd be chatting up what's-her-name. T'Soni.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08087",
   "en": "It's not. I just thought we were getting along pretty well. Sir.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08088",
   "en": "No worries, sir. Probably for the best anyway. The regs frown on fraternization.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08089",
   "en": "I read you, sir.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08090",
   "en": "I won't keep you any more. Have fun. Commander.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08091",
   "en": "Hmm. All right. But I'm the jealous type, Commander. Just so you know.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08092",
   "en": "Scuttlebutt says you've got a bit of thing for her.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08093",
   "en": "I could understand why. The crew's off-limits, with the regs against fraternization. And at least she looks like a woman.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08094",
   "en": "So you are interested in her.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08095",
   "en": "'Course, it could just be politics. Alien diplomat's daughter? Us under orders to make nice with the bug-eyed monsters?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08096",
   "en": "What's up? You didn't come by to eavesdrop on family mail.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08097",
   "en": "Sorry, Commander. Too much in the family mindset. My sisters and I have always been close.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08098",
   "en": "Yeah, we've always been close. Me and my sisters, especially.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08099",
   "en": "With Dad on duty so much, I had to help Mom raise them.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08100",
   "en": "Yeah. I'm the oldest, then Abby, then Lynn. Sarah's the youngest. She's still in high school.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08101",
   "en": "With four girls, Dad used to say he felt more outnumbered at home than on maneuvers.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08102",
   "en": "Yeah. Took any crap posting he could get that offered space time.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08103",
   "en": "He worked his ass off trying to get recognized. But he never got above Serviceman Third Class.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08104",
   "en": "I hope we can get the Council to give us a hand, skipper.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08105",
   "en": "Alenko-- the lieutenant. I'd hate to think his loss meant nothing. ",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08106",
   "en": "I'd hate to think we nuked a perfectly nice world for nothing.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08107",
   "en": "Hey, skipper. Seems like everything's coming together.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08108",
   "en": "After what we saw on Virmire, it better come together.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08109",
   "en": "Alenko-- the lieutenant. I'd hate to think his loss meant nothing.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08110",
   "en": "If we get Udina on our side, he'll tell the Council to take a flying leap. If necessary.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08111",
   "en": "How you holding up, skipper?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08112",
   "en": "I hate being right.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08113",
   "en": "Hey, Commander. Guess everything's gonna hit the fan soon, huh?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08114",
   "en": "Sure. I was hoping to get a minute of your time. Off the record.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08115",
   "en": "Sure. I was just watching some mail from home.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08116",
   "en": "All right? You mean, did you break my heart?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08117",
   "en": "Just use, uh, protection. Tinfoil hat, maybe?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08118",
   "en": "We've got a hard fight ahead.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08119",
   "en": "You mean the rachni, right?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08120",
   "en": "Kinda wish you'd got there sooner, Commander.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08121",
   "en": "I keep an open-door policy. If you have any concerns, lay them on me.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08122",
   "en": "It's not normal for an enlisted to speak informally with the commander.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08123",
   "en": "Is this duty-related, Chief?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08124",
   "en": "They may not serve the Alliance, Chief, but they're allies. At least as far as Saren goes.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08125",
   "en": "He may not serve the Alliance, Chief, but he's an ally. At least as far as Saren goes.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08126",
   "en": "You don't trust their motives because they're not human.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08127",
   "en": "You don't trust his motives because he's not human.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08128",
   "en": "Don't mince words, Chief. What's your concern?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08129",
   "en": "You don't trust the Alliance's allies?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08130",
   "en": "That's enough, Chief. You always second-guess your superiors?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08131",
   "en": "I share your concerns, Chief. But I'm under orders.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08132",
   "en": "I'm not going to lock them in sleeper pods for the whole trip, Williams.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08133",
   "en": "I'm not going to lock him in a sleeper pod for the whole trip, Williams.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08134",
   "en": "Standing up for ourselves doesn't mean standing alone.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08135",
   "en": "I trust that's not insubordination I hear.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08136",
   "en": "How do you get from \"relying on ourselves\" to \"mistreating our allies?\"",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08137",
   "en": "You've got a pessimistic view of the universe, Williams.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08138",
   "en": "The Council's had a grudge against us since the First Contact War.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08139",
   "en": "I don't see that as inevitable.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08140",
   "en": "These seem like deeply-held beliefs, Williams. What made you think this way?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08141",
   "en": "This is an Alliance warship, not the Parliament floor. If you're \"Earth first,\" vote for the Terra Firma Party.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08142",
   "en": "You sound like one of those Terra Firma Party pamphlets, Chief.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08143",
   "en": "I come from a military family, too. My parents were both navy. Anybody in your family we might know?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08144",
   "en": "I never knew my family. Grew up an orphan on Earth. Anybody in your family I'd have heard of?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08145",
   "en": "You're lucky. I lost my family on Mindoir. Are you related to anyone I'd have heard of?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08146",
   "en": "I don't think they meant to start a family tradition. But after sixteen years on ships and stations, how could I spend my life on the ground?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08147",
   "en": "I saw a lot of people die. I can't sit back and let things like that happen.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08148",
   "en": "Mainly, I wanted to serve. Protect the Alliance, save lives. You know.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08149",
   "en": "No. The future of humanity is out here. There's so much we haven't seen yet.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08150",
